List, update, and restore DLSS/FSR/XeSS DLLs for games.

Usage:
  spela dll [command]

Available Commands:
  check-updates Check for DLL updates
  list          List detected DLLs
  restore       Restore original DLLs from backup
  update        Update a DLL to the latest version

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for dll

Use "spela dll [command] --help" for more information about a command.
